    "title": "Newburgh school board votes to reinstate superintendent - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spectrum News Staff ,\n11 hours ago The Newburgh Board of Education voted Wednesday to reinstate its superintendent. The board voting 5-4 to reinstate Jackielyn Manning Campbell as superintendent. It comes after the board suspended her in January pending an ongoing and undisclosed investigation. With the vote, her suspension is rescinded as are the charges against her. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
